>会议听取[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>中共中央政治局委员、全国政协副主席[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hr-plain\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"head3\">大型水陆两栖飞机 AG600“鲲龙”<br>完成全部取证试飞科目</div>\n\n    <div class=\"three-cols illegible\">\n      <p>新华社北京3月1日电（记者胡喆）[illegible]，我国自主研制的大型水陆两栖飞机AG600“鲲龙”完成全部取证试飞科目。</p>\n      <p>AG600是[illegible]</p>\n      <p>AG600“鲲龙”飞机是我国[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ------------ RIGHT COLUMN ------------ -->\n  <div class=\"col-right\">\n\n    <!-- article 1 body (continues from masthead headline) -->\n    <div class=\"header-cols\">\n      <p class=\"illegible\">“人民幸福安康是推动高质量发展的最终目的。”</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">中国特色社会主义[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">新华社[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n\n      <div class=\"sec-sub\">中国式现代化，民生为大</div>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">为中国人民谋幸福，[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">2021年3月，习近平总书记[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">中华大地，中国especially[?]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n\n      <p class=\"illegible\">“更满意的天[?]伴，让人民过上幸福生活是头等大事”[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">2021年春，习近平总书记[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">2022年，在春节团拜会上[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n\n      <div class=\"sec-sub\">在发展中保障和改善<br>民生是中国式现代化的<br>重大任务</div>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">民生问题是发展问题的重要方面。</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">2023年，[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[ill